# Social & contact scope

When managing **social networks** or **contact location** (phone, maps), change only the files below. Do not edit hero, gallery, video, services, or unrelated scripts/styles.

## Social (links + QR popovers)

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| All platform URLs, tooltips, QR paths | `scripts/config.js` → `social` array |
| Render nav icons, section cards, QR UI | `scripts/modules/social.js` |
| Section shell | `components/social.html` |
| Nav icon row (empty container) | `components/FULLGREATBROS.html` — **only** `.social-row` |
| Styles | `styles/social.css` |
| Icons | `assets/svg/youtube.svg`, `bilibili.svg`, `instagram.svg`, `rednote.svg`, `tiktok.svg` |
| QR images | `assets/svg/rednoteQR.svg`, `assets/svg/tiktokQR.svg` (no spaces in filenames) |

Platform behavior:

- `type: "link"` — hover shows `tooltip`, click opens `url` in a new tab.
- `type: "qr"` — hover shows `tooltip`, click opens `qrImage` in a popover; click outside or Escape closes.

## Contact (phone + directions)

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Phone + maps URL | `scripts/config.js` → `phone`, `location` |
| Apply to DOM | `scripts/modules/apply-config.js` |
| Markup | `components/contact.html` |
| Styles | `styles/contact.css` |

## Do not

- Put social URLs in HTML by hand — use `FGS_CONFIG.social` only.
- Re-add Tabler icon social buttons (`ti-brand-instagram`, etc.) unless the user asks.

If a change needs another file, ask the user first.
